msgid ""
"The method to display an image preview. Choose from:  - ``\"external\"``: "
"External PDF preview using the default PDF viewer - ``\"notebook\"``: Inline "
"PNG preview in the current notebook - ``\"none\"``: Disable image preview - "
"``None``: Reset to the default display method, which is either "
"``\"external\"``   in Python consoles or ``\"notebook\"`` in Jupyter "
"notebooks."
msgstr ""

